  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Materials used: Risograph soy ink, cyanotype prints on cotton fabric, archival stamp inks; handmade papers made of dried herbs &amp; grass from artist's backyard, recycled paper pulp, abaca plant pulp, tumeric; mulberry papers machine made of kozo, hemp &amp; pulp; Plike Text Black 95 lb/140g.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Hand-quilted cotton fabric cover with open edges. Dried herbs stitched inside a mulberry paper lining (linden, motherwort, elecampane, Solomon's seal, marshmallow). Stab binding.</subfield>
  </datafield>
